 "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Video_thumbnail.png", "id": "1022484881201708", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12410199_1022484884535041_2147112256_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v1BgJAcdpdcQ7kNvwGlcFhe&_nc_oc=Adpp4EctfQxuGNHXJ9TaUMzy7Pfo1Vk91QiLdmsRhkXIfKoAw595tyH34ASVjRBzMVE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS_iiw4U0zjAlnRcA56PLjX3nqwzOBlndserkVKndjvCw&oe=6B0B3163"}, "display_name": "Hypercade", "keywords": ["Classic", "Aracade", "Action"], "long_description": "Hypercade brings a modern spin to nostalgic arcade action in VR, with simple to use controls paired with classic arcade challenge.  Play four incredible arcade classics completely hands free or with a controller.  Brought to you by acclaimed VR game developer Hidden Path Entertainment, Hypercade includes four arcade games, each with its own unique take on fan favorites of yesteryear.    \n\nDodge dive-bombing aliens in Space Swarm, a classic vertical shooter featuring waves of unique enemy flight formations and challenging special bonus stages.  Evade the onslaught of multi-legged creatures in Crazy Critters, but beware - shoot them in the middle and they'll divide in half!  Save humanity from homicidal robots in Robo Rush, a classic twin-stick shooter featuring a unique hands-free mode. Maneuver your paddle with a glance as you deflect a bouncing crystal to smash through walls of gems and collect special power-ups in Breaker Blaster.\n\nGet Hypercade now!\n", "short_description": "Hypercade brings a modern spin to nostalgic arcade action in VR, with simple to use controls paired with classic arcade challenge.\n\nPlay four incredible arcade classics completely hands free or with a controller.  Brought to you by acclaimed VR game developer Hidden Path Entertainment, Hypercade includes four arcade games, each with its own unique take on fan favorites of yesteryear.    "}]